            <ArticleTitle>[Expression of GIRK4 gene in kidney tissues of obese rat].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>36-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3881/j.issn.1000-503X.2013.01.007</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">To investigate the expression of GIRK4 gene in the kidney tissues of obese rats.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">Obese rat models were established using diet-induced method. The GIRK4 protein expression in kidney tissues was determined in 20 obese rats and 10 normal rats using Western blot analysis.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">The relative expression level of GIRK4 protein in the kidney tissues of obese rat (1.75±0.42) was significantly lower than that in normal rats (3.37±0.68, P&lt;0.05).</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">GIRK4 has a low protein expression in the kidney tissues of obese rat.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
